  "version": "0.10.2",
  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.2 rebuilds Yone around the three active slots exposed by Mod API 0.8: a hit-gated Q1/Q2/Q3 with guarded stack transitions and one airborne wind lane, an E-spirit plus 48,000-range W-crescent composite slot with visible outbound/BackToCaster return, fixed body marker, a five-frame body swing, one non-tower-enemy damage hitbox, a separate champion-only capped shield probe and no knock-up, and the existing six-slash R approximation. The public data API cannot restore real hero coordinates, so E is explicitly documented as a visual return approximation. It preserves official audio, all 13 native animation tags, frame rectangles and timings, compact portrait fixes, and the existing Rift quality pack and League-style UI/audio. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
  "last_updated": "2026-07-14",
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.5.0"
    }
  ]
